== Visiting ==
Players can visit other players' Private Islands using the command {{Code|/visit <player>}} or through {{NPCSprite|Christopher}}. Visiting other players' islands grants [[Social]] XP.

The maximum number of visitors on the player's own Private Island can be increased using the Guests Limit [[Account & Profile Upgrades#Profile Upgrades|Profile Upgrade]]. The first upgrade is free, but subsequent upgrades require [[SkyBlock Gems]]. The Guests Limit before upgrades depends on the highest rank among the owners of the island, as shown in the table below.

