== Managing ==
=== Spawn Location ===
Players can set their own spawn position by sleeping in a bed, or by using {{Code|/spawnlocation}}, {{Code|/setspawn}}, or {{Code|/sethome}}. This location is separate from the location where Guests will spawn when they visit the island, which can be set using {{Code|/guestlocation}}.

=== Kicking ===
When there are one or more Guests on a player's Private Island, the owner can use either {{Code|/sbkickall}} to kick all Guests from their island or {{Code|/sbkick <player>}} to kick a specific player. Kicking a player also temporarily bans them from the island.

=== Island Settings ===
The player can change settings for their Banking API and island visitor restrictions in the Island Settings menu, which can be accessed from the Settings page of the [[SkyBlock Menu]]. The player can allow visits from any combination of three options: Anyone, Friends, and Guild. The interface for the Island Settings menu is shown below.
