* {{Item|Beacon}} - Maximum of {{Green|1}}
* {{Item|Egg Hunt}} - Maximum of {{Green|10}}
* {{Item|Teleport Pad}} - Maximum of {{Green|56}}

=== Non-block Placeable Limit ===
{{Main|Furniture}}
The player can place [[Furniture]] in their island up to {{Green|15}}.

Some special furniture and entities have their own limit set and are excluded from the main limit:
* [[Century Cakes]] - Maximum of {{Green|16}}
* {{Item|Experimentation Table}} - Maximum of {{Green|1}}
* [[Floating Crystals]] - Maximum of {{Green|1}} for each type
* {{Item|Great Spook Tree}} - Maximum of {{Green|1}}
* {{Item|Island NPC}} - Maximum of {{Green|21}}
* {{Item|Placeable Fairy Soul}} - Maximum of {{Green|1}}
* {{Item|Postcard}} - Maximum of {{Green|1}}
