== Trivia ==
* If the player falls into the void, they do not lose any {{Coins}} unless they are in [[Combat]], Death from any other source of damage such as fall damage or suffocation causes the player to lose {{Coins}}.
* All fortune stats except for {{Stat|hunting fortune}}, as well as {{Stat|Mining Spread}} (except on {{Gamemode|Stranded}}), and {{Stat|Sweep}} are disabled on Private Islands.
** If the player breaks a mature crop, the following message will show to remind them: {{Dialogue|&6&lSTAT ALERT! &rFarming Fortune doesn't work on your Private Island! Try farming in Public Islands or The Garden instead! &2&l[I GET IT]}}
* There is a limit of 64 simultaneous primed [[TNT]] entities on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}} and {{Zone|The Garden}}.
** This limit was added because of {{RN|youtube|SomethingLT}}.<ref>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qH0JOQIUEaw</ref>

